	(text_box "Get a early stable 2.5V from REGN, it's used for internal pin ILIM_HIZ.\nThis need to be done because we need to setup ILIM_HIZ before stable 3.3V is setup.\nUse a 2.5V shunt (TI TL431) to derivate 2.5V from ~4-6V REGN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 35.56 0)
		(size 43.18 15.24)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
